Description: 4k intro for Linux by Luminaire, released in 2015
 Strata is a 4k intro released by Luminaire at Assembly 2015, where it
 ended 5th in the combined 4k competition. It raymarches red cube
 lattices, tunnels and letters built from cubes.
 .
 The intro uses OpenGL and SDL 1.2. The music is written as raw audio on
 the standard output and played with pw-play, paplay or aplay.
